    "All11 requested missing arms completed25 updates and101 evaluations each; all validation truth hashes match saved controls.",
    "Bands+SDF+depth leads this fold/seed at76.0357% validation Dice; both FN and FP improve versus saved bands.",
    "Depth-containing recipes dominate this campaign. Matched new-arm additions of depth improve SDF, bands+SDF, and bands+edge+SDF.",
    "Edge effects depend on the combination: small positive average changes in some recipes, negative changes with bands+depth and bands+SDF+depth. Sequential calibration also changes later-term coefficients, so these are recipe comparisons, not isolated fixed-coefficient causal effects.",
